WEBVTT

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.140
This scenery sure does take me back.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.860
I sense his presence, kupo.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:10.430
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:10.430
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:17.930
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:17.930
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:27.040
With our eyes on the future

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:27.040
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:33.150
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:33.150
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:42.790
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:42.790
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:50.300
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:50.300
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:56.010
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:56.010
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:05.510
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:05.510
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.220
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:25.100
Our travelers searching for Flying Water,
the source of energy for their flying machine,

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:27.940
are still inside of the Ocean Puzzle.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.140
There's someone waiting for them. His name is...

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.370
This place really feels like home.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.980
But this is still a cube in the Ocean Puzzle.

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:03.340
We can't let our guard down.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.380
Don't be so uptight.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:07.510
It's important to take a break sometimes.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.520
What do you think? Doesn't it
remind you of your homeland too?

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.770
All hands have two hours of free time!

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:26.790
Use this time to relax while you can!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.410
What is this place? It looks like Japan.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.910
This smell reminds me of something.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:18.980
Lisa...

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.920
It reminds me of my childhood.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:30.970
This smell has got to be basilico
flavored khimaira croquettes!

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.160
My mom used to make those for me all the time.

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:36.800
No, this smell is pirozhki!

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:39.170
This place is so strange.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.670
Hey, someone is here.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:45.080
What was that?

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.010
A monster?

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:47.870
Lisa!

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.480
Did you say something?

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.690
Mom...

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.030
Wait, Lisa!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:11.560
Lisa!

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:21.050
Mom, I'm going to work even harder
at my Kigen Arts training.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.820
Are you drunk?

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:24.790
I'm going to go get Knave!

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.280
Hey, wait!

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:28.790
Knave!

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:30.250
Where are you?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:38.490
Without basilisk, you just can't
make a proper basilico.

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:43.040
This is no good. Our leader is already gone.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.570
What do you mean by, "gone"?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.340
What in the world is going on here?!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.610
Anyway, we've got to tell everyone!

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:56.770
What?!

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.450
Even Miles?!

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.530
Oh, Miles is gone too.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:08.360
But it looks like she's having fun.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.870
I have a really bad feeling about this.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.000
What should we do?

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.560
That's right! Poshepocket!

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.430
Give us something that will
help us cure everyone!

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:25.640
Hey, wake up!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.050
Is this also because of the Ocean Puzzle?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.970
Cid might know what to do!

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:45.700
Cid! Everyone is acting weird!

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:53.340
This is the Zero style
with his weapons upgraded!

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:55.480
How is he better than the old style, you ask?

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:58.680
He has two more boosters on his back!

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:04.890
They really increase his mobility during
hand-to-hand combat.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:04.020
Cid is gone too

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:06.580
Oh, this sucks!

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.250
Only Kaze is left now.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.330
Mister!

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.860
Kaze!

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:20.840
I feel so nice and toasty in this
Wonderland hot spring.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.300
It must be 300 degrees in here!

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:29.810
But that's too hot! We're gonna be boiled alive!

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:27.980
Is that the sound of a TV?
I wonder if Kaze is in here?

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.480
It's probably not him.

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:30.450
I'm going to check.

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:33.580
It feels so good. Usually I go in at 120 degrees.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:35.350
Hey, this isn't a hot spring!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.850
It's not even water!

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.120
I'm freezing up!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:42.320
Hey, you are freezing! What are you
gonna do about that?!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.930
Pass the syrup!

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:45.560
What are you doing, making a snow cone?

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.130
Ow, I have a brain freeze!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.200
You ate too much!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.630
It looks like he's in there...

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:53.370
That's one of those old variety shows.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.070
Does Kaze like that kind of comedy show?

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:57.230
I doubt it.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:07:59.740
An enemy?!

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.210
It's not Kaze.

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:14.180
It looks like a mini-Mister.

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.280
Who are you guys, kupo?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.690
You tell us your name first!

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:25.700
I am the harmless, charming mascot
everyone loves, Moogle, kupo!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:27.630
What is that?

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:32.740
I am a Soil missionary! By the way,
my last name is Kupo, kupo.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.370
What is that, kupo?!
I'm not joking around with you!

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:36.940
Is that the same Soil as Kaze's?

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:39.810
What? Do you know him, kupo?

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:43.250
If you know Kaze, does that mean
you're on our side?

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:46.090
If that's the case, can you turn
everyone back to normal?

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.480
You've hypnotized them
or something, haven't you?

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.780
Kupo... I haven't done anything, kupo.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:53.390
Really?

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.420
So why are you all right then?

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.600
Your friends have been trapped
in Memory Lane, kupo.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:13.570
Stop laughing at the TV and say something!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:18.350
This is Memory Lane, the last stop
on the memory train.

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:24.280
When someone becomes lost here, no one can
do anything but think of old memories, kupo.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:27.060
And then in the end,

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:31.370
they become consumed by their memories
and vanish completely, kupo.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:34.030
So Lisa and the others too?

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.960
So why is it that we're fine?

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.840
Young kids have fewer memories than adults.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:41.040
That's just common sense.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.610
So what about you?

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:49.910
I have an electric shock safety device that
prevents confusion, kupo!

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:54.480
You're pretty suspicious.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.410
The really suspicious thing here
is that thing, kupo!

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.090
That thing is sending out
weird radio waves, kupo.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.860
Nothing beats the good ol' days!

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:13.810
If we do something about that weird tower,
then everyone will return to normal, right?

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:25.020
Kaze!

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:25.950
What?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:32.350
I knew you were still alive.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.630
I've been looking for you.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:36.150
What have you been doing this whole time?

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:40.560
I haven't seen you since
we were separated in Windaria.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.360
It's amazing that we both survived that.

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:45.970
Since then I've been...

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.470
Who are you?

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.150
Hey, do you really know Mister here?

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:58.380
Hey, there's something written over here.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.890
What? Where?

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.390
In the 108th year of the age of Wonderland,

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:07.460
Nostarudamus, the king of black magic,
sealed a god named Yarukiel

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:09.900
here in this land and brought eternal peace.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.060
People shall only live in their memories.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.470
What is that?

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:21.180
Nothing beats the good ol' days!

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.200
These are dangerous radio waves!

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.300
Yu!

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.020
Hey, you want to play Old Maid?

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.550
Sis used to get so mad,

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.920
she would never let me
stop playing until she won.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:38.380
So we would always end up playing until
morning and we'd both be late to school.

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:40.060
Yu...

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:41.860
Yu is gone too.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:47.560
Hey, blow that thing away with the Magun!

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.430
Soil is my power!

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:02.280
Old Maid, Old Maid!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:16.630
Do it, god of destruction!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:21.030
Nothing beats the good ol' days!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.470
It's not moving.

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:35.810
I guess it's over.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.150
Why?

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.410
What happened?

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:44.450
Nothing beats the good ol' days!

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:05.570
How have you been using
this thing in this condition?

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:08.780
You know you can't heat up the Soil like that.

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:13.480
But don't worry, leave it to me
and I'll fix it right up.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.320
What? What are you doing?

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:22.590
All right! lt's not perfect, but it'll be
good enough to beat that thing.

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.260
Hey! Hey!

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.800
<i>What's wrong? What are you remembering?</i>

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:42.810
<i>Is it Aura?</i>

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.950
<i>Snap out of it!</i>

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:50.980
Don't tell me Memory Lane
has gotten to you too!

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:55.190
Oh, this is getting really bad, kupo.

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:56.600
Hey, you guys!

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:02.440
All right, one more, we're going to play
just one more time.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.340
Sis, you just never give up, do you?

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.510
They're all gone.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:11.610
This is pitiful!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.680
That a man like you has been
turned into an imbecile!

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:17.310
Did you forget about the days
when we fought together?

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:20.080
Have you lost touch with the Soil?

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.790
Oh, so good! It tastes just like my mother's!

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:25.350
I could eat these forever!

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:29.660
<i>Froggy, where are you?</i>

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:35.530
<i>Mom, I'm going to work even harder!</i>

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:41.710
This is my absolute favorite thing to do
in the whole world!

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:44.040
Not so fast.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.570
You can't beat me.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.980
<i>Sheesh, I guess I'm the only one left
to take care of things.</i>

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:55.750
<i>But your memories shouldn't be so pleasant
that you can totally immerse yourself in them.</i>

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.120
<i>Use it! Aura's Soil!</i>

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.860
Moogle...

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:44.630
Wow! So you found a memory of me
from somewhere in your heart?!

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.100
All right! Move, Magun!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.310
Just as the Soil guides you!

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:54.310
It has moved.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.740
Soil is my power!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.510
The Magun has thawed!

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.620
Nothing beats the good ol' days!

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.360
You're just wasting your energy now!

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:45.060
Hey! Go ahead and decide on
the appropriate Soil, kupo!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:48.170
Whatever you have left over
should be fine, kupo!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.400
The appropriate Soil to use against
you has been decided!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.740
The sleep that wraps death,
Steel Gray!

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:12.420
Bubbling and boiling blood,
Heat Crimson!

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:21.370
Finally, the light that penetrates darkness,
Lightning Yellow!

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:37.880
Howl! I summon you, Ixion!

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:52.730
It's Zero style, kupo!

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:42.650
Nothing beats the good ol' days...

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.960
Moogle...

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:01.300
You remember me.

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.670
I have such bad heartburn.

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:11.980
What the heck?

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.840
It's breaking apart!

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:16.840
Run, run!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.750
Hurry, get to the submarine!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:33.600
Quickly now! Don't push!

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:35.100
We're getting out of here!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.030
We're safe now, aren't we, Sis?

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.160
It looked really bad back there though.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.110
That place...

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.980
We are together now.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:23.610
Forever...

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express passes through the night

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express hashirisaru

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Riding into the distance

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Toorisugiru yakei ni

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Let me hear more of your heart

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Motto kokoro kikasete

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Let me close my eyes and be intoxicated

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Hitomi tojite yowasete

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Only the two of us are being taken

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Futari dake wo tsurete ku

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
On this trip that we began with nothing but love

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
Ai dake tsurete tabidatsu

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.600
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.600
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Bring your tired heart

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Tsukareta sono kokoro wo

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.850
Romancing train, whistle again

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.850
Romancing train, whistle again

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.150
It embraces me softly

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.150
Yasashiku daite kureru

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.050
And I know that there is love here

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.050
Ai ga koko ni aru koto

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:30.350
Whisper into my ear until I fall asleep

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:30.350
Nemuru made mimimoto de sasayaite ite

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.550
Clouds hang low deep in the night
as the moonlight shines through

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.550
Moonlight terasu shinya no
tachikomeru hikui cloud

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.950
I can almost touch it if I reach out,
flying higher than ever

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.950
Kono te nobaseba todokisou
tsukinukete maiagaru hodo

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.650
Yeah, I turn the pages of my book softly
so as not to awaken you

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.650
Yeah yawaraka ni nemuru
kimi okosanai you ni mekuru

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.300
The old words in the paperback
tell a tale of romance

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.300
Paperback furui kotoba tsuzurareta romance

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.050
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.050
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.800
It moves onward with grace

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.800
Susunde yuku yuuga ni

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.400
On the romancing train

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.400
Romancing train futari wa

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.650
Together we seek out beauty

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.650
Utsukushisa wo motomete

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:07.450
Love is watching our dreams

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:07.450
Ai wa yume wo mite iru

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:19.530
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:24.630
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.870 --> 00:22:30.140
Those who seek arrive at their last stop.

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:36.270
Waiting for them there is Lou Lupus,
or is it the dangerous blue water?

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:43.790
Next time, I'll return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
